<% if (_audience === 'owner') { %>
Account Closure Confirmation
<% } else if (_audience === 'vendor') { %>
Service Disconnection Notice
<% } else { %>
Account Closure Notice
<% } %>

Hello,

<% if (_audience === 'owner') { %>
This confirms that your account for <%= companyName %> has been closed on <%= effectiveDate %>.

Closure Summary:
- <%= leasesTerminated %> lease(s) terminated
- <%= staffDisconnected %> staff account(s) disconnected
- <%= vendorsDisconnected %> vendor(s) disconnected

What Happens Next:
- Move-out inspections have been auto-scheduled for all active leases
- Security deposit refunds will be processed after inspections complete
- All staff and vendor access has been revoked
- Your account is now suspended - data is retained but inaccessible

If this was done in error, please contact our support team within 30 days to discuss account reactivation options.
<% } else if (_audience === 'staff') { %>
We are writing to inform you that <%= companyName %> has closed their account on our platform, effective <%= effectiveDate %>.

What This Means For You:
- Your account has been set to read-only mode
- You will no longer be able to create or modify resources
- Your existing data will remain accessible for reference
- No further action is required on your part

If you have any questions about this change, please contact the account administrator or reach out to our support team.
<% } else if (_audience === 'tenant') { %>
We are writing to inform you that <%= companyName %> has closed their account on our platform, effective <%= effectiveDate %>.

What This Means For You:
- Your lease has been terminated as part of this closure
- Any security deposit refund will be processed after your move-out inspection
- Outstanding payments prior to closure remain on record
- You will no longer have access to the tenant portal for this property
- Your payment and lease history will remain available for reference

If you have any questions about your lease, security deposit, or outstanding payments, please contact your property manager directly or reach out to our support team.
<% } else if (_audience === 'vendor') { %>
We are writing to inform you that <%= companyName %> has closed their account on our platform, effective <%= effectiveDate %>.

What This Means For You:
- Your vendor account has been disconnected from <%= companyName %>
- Any pending payouts will be processed according to the existing schedule
- You will no longer receive new service requests from this client
- Your account on our platform remains active for other clients

If you have questions about pending payouts or this disconnection, please contact our support team.
<% } %>
